- Leadership experience across both commercial and operational teams, including direct management of managers and key accounts;

- Strong strategic thinking and project leadership skills, with the ability to translate frameworks into impactful local execution;

- Experience in B2B account management or joint business planning with large retailers or marketplaces;

- Proven track record of driving operational performance in a retail, e-commerce, logistics or on-demand environment;

- Excellent stakeholder management skills across different cultures, levels and functions;

- Highly analytical, data-driven, and comfortable making decisions based on insights;

- Hands-on mentality with the ability to operate both at strategic and operational levels;

- Outstanding communication and negotiation skills, with fluent English (other regional languages are a plus);

- Willingness to travel across the region as needed;

- Nice to Have:

- Background in retail operations, supply chain or last-mile logistics;

- Previous exposure to management consulting, strategic project management, or business development roles;

- Familiarity with CRM tools (e.g. Salesforce) and data analytics platforms.

